{"id":1920,"name":"Mobile Police Patlabor","slug":"mobile_police_patlabor","synopsis":"In the future, advanced robotics has created heavy robots (\"labors\") for use in a variety of functions: construction, fire-fighting, military, and more. However, though the robots are only machines, their operators are also only human - and humans sometimes turn to crime. Since a heavy labor unit can be a dangerous weapon, the police of the future are set to fight fire with fire, using advanced patrol labor units, \"patlabors\". This is the story of the Second Special Vehicles Division, a motley crew of patlabor policemen and -women doing their best to fight crime and live a normal life. \n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":1989,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:16","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 05:27:08","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":324},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":324},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":291},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":778},{"site":"ANN","externalId":59},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":611},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":3831,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/YUUgTgJ9ASBB1539MxfSne2xQsieXJYxQtNo5Jfn.jpg"},{"id":3832,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/VzxyAx573OkYdD2eKJzGtzCZpzSJfhX0NkNg7dGE.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":25,"name":"Sunrise","slug":"sunrise"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":114,"name":"Mobile Police Patlabor","slug":"patlabor"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":360,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":1,"song":{"id":360,"title":"Sono Mama no Kimi de Ite","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":398,"version":1,"episodes":"1-??","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":12704,"basename":"MobilePolicePatlabor-OP1.webm","filename":"MobilePolicePatlabor-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/MobilePolicePatlabor-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":18812364,"resolution":720,"nc":true,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE","sourc